+# This code is original from jsmin by Douglas Crockford, it was translated to
+# Python by Baruch Even. It was rewritten by Dave St.Germain for speed.
+#
+# The MIT License (MIT)
+# 
+# Copyright (c) 2013 Dave St.Germain
+# 
